{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Atiyah--Singer族指标定理"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Atiyah–Singer 族指标定理”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $X\\to B$ 是紧合淹没 (proper submersion), 此时 Atiyah–Singer 族指标定理 (family index theorem)</p>\n"}}